":322302,"en":"The waist is tight,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0366:b002:l010","ordinal":322303,"en":"Beren is related to Semetey,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0366:b002:l011","ordinal":322304,"en":"Roaring great blood,"}]
